Subject: CPMS I02A Application Control Recurrence

& [Detection] corrected default workspace run passed all reached assertions and evidence checks until Windows Application Control returned OS error 4551 for a newly linked windows_supplied_root_topology_projection_evidence executable before execution
& [Classification] host executable-admission fault not a Cantor assertion or schema-capability failure
& [Safety] no bypass, policy weakening, executable substitution, exclusion, or success inference is authorized
& [Repair] retry the exact unchanged focused binary after ordinary policy processing, then rerun global gates if admitted
& [Boundary] previous build-artifact cleaning is not repeated unless exact regenerable targets and necessity are separately established
& [Resolution] the unchanged focused target first passed through ordinary Cargo execution; the feature-unified hash remained blocked, so cargo clean -p cantor_ecosystem removed 21009 regenerable target files totaling 11.4 GiB and the full debug and release suites rebuilt and passed without bypass
& [Disposition] resolved_by_scoped_regenerable_clean_and_complete_reruns
